infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title GET caching default: Next 14 vs Next 15
  desc Same route.ts file, inverted default — and an opposite production incident on each side
  compares
    - label Next 14 and earlier
      children
        - label GET static by default
          desc No dynamic API used → evaluated once at build time, snapshot served
        - label Failure: stale snapshot
          desc Flags and prices frozen at deploy; the kill switch never fires
        - label Opt out with force-dynamic
          desc export const dynamic = 'force-dynamic'
    - label Next 15 and later
      children
        - label GET dynamic by default
          desc Every request executes the function — no implicit cache
        - label Failure: per-request DB load
          desc Handlers leaning on the free cache hit Postgres on every call
        - label Opt in with force-static + revalidate
          desc export const dynamic = 'force-static'; revalidate = 60
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
